<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners sell 295.45 mln rand S.Africa bonds Fri.</title>
<headline>Foreigners sell 295.45 mln rand S.Africa bonds Fri.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners sold a net 295.45 million rands worth of South African bonds on Friday after buying 347.98 on Thursday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
